  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W45",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周先驱四场比赛，黑绿恶魔拿下两个冠军、八个八强，高分占比达到25%，本周胜率57.3%。加入杰斯后持续输出成绩的红蓝创新以10.9%的高分占比排在第二。",
          "en": "Golgari Demons won two of the four Pioneer events and took eight Top 8 spots. It made up 25% of high-scoring decks and posted a 57.3% match win rate. Izzet Creativity continues to put up results with [[card:The Theorist, Jace Beleren|The Theorist, Jace Beleren]] and ranked second at 10.9% of high-scoring decks."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周大黑献力也拿下一个四强和一个亚军。满编[[card:Dark Matter Manipulator|暗物质操弄师]]、[[card:Stitcher's Supplier|拼接师备尸]]和[[card:Overlord of the Balemurk|灾沼霸主]]，再用[[card:Baron Helmut Zemo|赫尔穆特·泽莫男爵]]把坟场转成资源：deck:5b351e2a7eae7541cd53。",
          "en": "Mono-Black Devotion took a Top 4 finish and a runner-up finish. deck:5b351e2a7eae7541cd53 runs four each of [[card:Dark Matter Manipulator|Dark Matter Manipulator]], [[card:Stitcher's Supplier|Stitcher's Supplier]], and [[card:Overlord of the Balemurk|Overlord of the Balemurk]], then turns the graveyard into a resource with [[card:Baron Helmut Zemo|Baron Helmut Zemo]]."
        },
